     "text": "```json\n{\"reachable\": true, \"rationale\": \"The target is still reachable even with apiToken:authenticate and rdpLogin:authenticate blocked. One working path: wifiGuest:initialAccess (entry) leads to workstation:execution, which leads to browserStore:credentialAccess. Separately, wifiGuest:initialAccess leads to mailClient:execution, which leads to tokenCache:credentialAccess. dbLogin:authenticate is an AND step, and both of its parents (browserStore:credentialAccess and tokenCache:credentialAccess) are reached, so it is reachable. From there, jumpHost:lateralMovement, then dbReplica:collection, then crownData:exfiltrate. The same dbLogin:authenticate step also unlocks printServer:lateralMovement, which leads to shareMount:collection and vaultRead:collection, giving further routes to the target.\"}\n```"
